        <mxCell id="e7" value="&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt; · sau commit: CvParseCommand&lt;br&gt;rk cv.parse" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;" edge="1" parent="1" source="csvc" target="exch"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1010" y="307" /><mxPoint x="1010" y="205" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
